# Claude Code: authored content is shareable, everything else is machine-local.
# Skills, commands, agents, hooks and settings.json are written by hand and
# belong in the repo. The rest is per-machine state: personal permissions,
# locks, worktrees, history.
# Applies to every repo here, so no project needs its own rule.
# CLAUDE.md sits outside .claude/ and is unaffected.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/settings.json
